    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KARIN\u2019S INSTRUCTION</h2>\u201cKarin's Instruction\u201d is a tank-themed parkour game where, through your efforts, you engage in various intimate interactions with coach Karin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/4b51b304cd98062b1700b4dffb86740d.avif?t=1726650581\" width=228 height=400 /></span><br>Name\uff1aKarin Lorenz<br>Age\uff1a24<br><br>It may seem a bit aloof, but it has a gentle side. Due to professional reasons, it often gives off an impression of being difficult to approach. However, deep down, there is a desire for someone to rely on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=598 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.mp4?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Drive your tank on a straight road, with many vehicles blocking your way. Utilize your exceptional driving skills to maneuver around them, or turn the turret and blast a shot to eliminate them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/ada60f84c7c7d8252149dcab1855fb76.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/ada60f84c7c7d8252149dcab1855fb76.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/ada60f84c7c7d8252149dcab1855fb76.mp4?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Earn rewards to purchase new tanks; the game offers dozens of WWII tanks to collect, each with unique characteristics.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/78f57fcf63ae2a4121a29dc9b78eae9e.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=160 /></span><br>Through four different areas, including expansive forest, dim temple, narrow city, and dangerous space. Showcase your skills and make your way to the goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/fed581b4b5f2c4a66e5aee158669de79.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/fed581b4b5f2c4a66e5aee158669de79.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/fed581b4b5f2c4a66e5aee158669de79.mp4?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/be8f4e14a5396604813833df3fa8806b.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/be8f4e14a5396604813833df3fa8806b.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/be8f4e14a5396604813833df3fa8806b.mp4?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Unlock stories with mileage. Coach Karin goes from distant to intimate in six animations, offering a concise yet rich plot for a satisfying experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/26d27bbc4b6f45bba7d8fb4637a526bb.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=76 /></span><br>Unlock challenge mode in different areas, improve your skills, and keep playing without getting bored as you strive to break records.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More</h2>The game supports playing at multiple resolutions, and playing on ultrawide or vertical screens adds more fun.",
